From: Duron27 <duron27@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Remove the obsolete Python relay and bots and the smoke-test script that needed them

server/relay.py, bot.py and owner_bot.py predate the join handshake (they never send "join" or a protocol version, so
the relay ignores them) and run-test.sh depended on them and on a hardcoded scratch path. The dedicated server
(openmw-mp-server) replaces the relay; the in-game test bot (bot.lua) replaces the Python bots.

---
